@@ -8,6 +8,24 @@ many small sections.
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+### EED-CCB-2026-0023 - 2026-08-20
+
+#### Fixed
+
+- Stabilised the add/edit image modal state path used by Fit to preview, Fill
+  banner, image selection, drag and resize. The modal now resolves its
+  `fitmodeoverride` field locally by id and then canonical name, writes form
+  fields before the active draft JSON and visual mirrors, and coalesces
+  filemanager refreshes per modal. Pointer gestures render visual feedback at
+  most once per frame and defer full draft serialization until release.
+
+#### Validation
+
+- Extended the static IMG-06 contract for the scoped-field resolver, shared
+  transaction ordering, deferred gesture serialization and coalesced
+  filemanager refresh queue. Crop, recrop, undo/redo, slideshow and the image
+  options accordion remain outside this change.
+
 ### 2026-08-18
 
 #### Fixed
